{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>This is an evil.</b> There is nothing done under the sun harder than this. Therefore the heart of the children of men is full of evil and folly in their heart, in their lives, while they are yet alive; and one may still say about the dead, and afterward it returns to the heart of the children of men. And he said regarding this matter <b>the children of men</b>, because all the small ones are harder on account of the shortness of their understanding."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:28:36.196274546Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}